## 1. Privacy Policy & Data Collection (Store Requirement)
To publish to the Chrome Web Store, you **must** provide a Privacy Policy URL. In your privacy policy, you must clearly explain the data collected and its purpose to avoid suspension.

**What to include in your Privacy Policy:**
> **Data Collected:** The ChromeOS Location Tracker extension collects the device's geographic location (GPS coordinates) and the enterprise Directory Device ID.
> **Purpose:** This data is collected solely for enterprise IT asset management and fleet tracking. The data is transmitted securely to the organization's internal IT portal to allow administrators to locate company-owned devices.
> **Data Sharing:** This data is not shared with any third parties, sold, or used for advertising. It is strictly used for internal IT administrative purposes.

