## 4. How "Force Refresh" Works
The extension on the Chromebook is asleep most of the time to save battery, waking up exactly every 15 minutes to ping. 
The **"↻ Force Refresh"** button does **not** instantly wake up the Chromebook (since we can't push a signal to a sleeping extension). Instead, it polls your Go backend database every 2 seconds for up to 30 seconds to see if a *new* ping has arrived during that window. If the Chromebook happens to ping during those 30 seconds, the UI will instantly auto-update with a success message!

