## 6. Pre-Publishing Code Checklist
Before zipping the `extension/` folder for the Web Store:
1. Open `extension/manifest.json` and remove `"http://localhost:8080/*",` from `host_permissions` so it only has your production domain.
2. Open `extension/background.js` and change `const API_URL = "http://localhost:8080/..."` to your production `https://...` URL.
3. Open `extension/background.js` and change `let deviceId = "3421537a...";` back to `let deviceId = "unknown";` (the `enterprise.deviceAttributes` API handles the real ID automatically in production).
